    "result": "**Creation Date:** August 6, 2026\n\n**Description:** A collection of skills designed for AI coding agents, compatible with both Claude Code and codex platforms. The repository focuses on novel-to-character conversion tools.\n\n**What It Does:** The primary skill, \"novel-characters,\" transforms novels into comprehensive character bibles, generating character profiles, cartoon design prompts, voice prompts, and turnaround sheets. Users can select the report language and image generation style.\n\n**Installation/Launch:** Users install via a shell script that detects whether Claude Code or codex is installed and creates symbolic links to all skills. The system requires Node.js 18 or higher and uses the current session's model quota without needing API keys. The installation allows selective skill installation and easy updates through git pull. Image generation requires the codex CLI. The project uses Apache 2.0 licensing and includes self-testing scripts for validation.\n\nThe repository structure emphasizes self-contained skills with mandatory SKILL.md files and selftest.mjs scripts that don't consume model quotas.",
