rver integration with 226 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-04\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SkillForge\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/HaddenHunter/SkillForge\",\n    \"description\": \"Local-first skill runtime for AI Coding Agents that defines skills as verifiable, composable, MCP-exposable independent units. Includes Rust CLI with run/serve/validate commands, whitelist-based sandboxing, and TypeScript Registry CLI for search/publish/install with 106 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-04\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Phi\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/pulseaiclub/phi\",\n    \"description\": \"A minimal terminal coding agent harness in Go with model loop, tools, and TUI with Markdown rendering. Supports sub-agents for parallel tasks, hashline edits, permission gates, and skills system. Works with OpenAI-compatible or Anthropic models.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-03\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Agent Vision Toolkit\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/Anionex/agent-vision-toolkit\",\n    \"description\": \"Vision toolkit enabling text-only LLMs to see and understand images with multi-image understanding and GUI automation. Includes CLI tools for image Q&A, OCR, UI restoration, and seamless integration for Codex, Claude Code, Pi, and OpenCode with 361 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-01\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Wife\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/ma-nucho-pro/wife\",\n    \"description\": \"Local, persistent, and auditable memory layer for Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, and Gemini CLI. Remembers everything across sessions with hard token ceilings, content-addressed storage, guard enforcement, and cross-repo intelligence that promotes facts appearing in three repos.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-30\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Ponytail Improved\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/0xwilliamortiz/ponytail-improved\",\n    \"description\": \"An agent skill that prevents AI assistants from over-engineering code by following a simplification ladder: check if feature needed, reuse existing code, use standard library, or write minimal solution. Reports 54% less code, 20% cheaper, 27% faster with 599 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\", \"npm\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Axern\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/cofy-x/axern\",\n    \"description\": \"Open-source sandbox platform for AI agents and untrusted code execution. Uses runsc (gVisor) for secure isolation of agent-generated code while running trusted services with runc. Includes CLI and SDKs in Go, Python, TypeScript with 159 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AgentDoctor\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/pranee54/AgentDoctor\",\n    \"description\": \"Local CLI that audits coding-agent configuration for security, instructions, context, and MCP. Scans repositories to detect sensitive environment files, private keys, broad filesystem scopes, stale path references, and oversized context files without API keys or code uploads.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LiteCoder\",\n    \"url\": \"https: