Remembers everything across sessions with hard token ceilings, content-addressed storage, guard enforcement, and cross-repo intelligence that promotes facts appearing in three repos.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-30\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Ponytail Improved\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/0xwilliamortiz/ponytail-improved\",\n    \"description\": \"An agent skill that prevents AI assistants from over-engineering code by following a simplification ladder: check if feature needed, reuse existing code, use standard library, or write minimal solution. Reports 54% less code, 20% cheaper, 27% faster with 599 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\", \"npm\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Axern\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/cofy-x/axern\",\n    \"description\": \"Open-source sandbox platform for AI agents and untrusted code execution. Uses runsc (gVisor) for secure isolation of agent-generated code while running trusted services with runc. Includes CLI and SDKs in Go, Python, TypeScript with 159 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AgentDoctor\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/pranee54/AgentDoctor\",\n    \"description\": \"Local CLI that audits coding-agent configuration for security, instructions, context, and MCP. Scans repositories to detect sensitive environment files, private keys, broad filesystem scopes, stale path references, and oversized context files without API keys or code uploads.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LiteCoder\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/ikooky/LiteCoder\",\n    \"description\": \"Practical cross-platform coding agent for terminal workflows with streaming terminal interface, built-in development tools, persistent sessions, context management, token budget tracking, Markdown-based workspace memory, multi-agent collaboration, and MCP server integrations.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Debroid\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/PatilShreyas/debroid\",\n    \"description\": \"Autonomous headless Android debugger designed for AI coding agents. Communicates via JDWP with deterministic JSON output for machine parsing. Enables agents to debug live Android apps without GUI, supporting breakpoints, watchpoints, variable inspection, and expression evaluation with 98 GitHub stars.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-08-02\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  }\n]\n",
